sequenceDiagram
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant WVA as WVA Controller Manager<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Scale as Scale Subresource<br/>autoscaling/v1/Scale

    Note over WVA: Startup sequence
    KubeAPI->>WVA: Leader election (Lease)<br/>coordination.k8s.io
    WVA->>KubeAPI: Watch ConfigMap<br/>SA: controller-manager
    KubeAPI-->>WVA: ConfigMap bootstrap<br/>dynamic configuration
    Note over WVA: Readiness probe passes<br/>(:8081/readyz)

    WVA->>Prom: Validate connection<br/>TLS 1.2+ / mTLS / Bearer token
    Prom-->>WVA: Connection OK<br/>(fail-fast on error)

    Note over WVA: Runtime reconciliation loop

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over KubeAPI,WVA: Controller Watches
        KubeAPI->>WVA: InferencePool events<br/>inference.networking.k8s.io/v1
        KubeAPI->>WVA: HPA events<br/>autoscaling/v2
        KubeAPI->>WVA: ScaledObject events (optional)<br/>keda.sh/v1alpha1
        KubeAPI->>WVA: ConfigMap changes
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over WVA,Prom: Metrics Collection
        WVA->>Prom: Query saturation metrics<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token or mTLS
        Prom-->>WVA: Inference workload metrics
        Note over WVA: Coordinator evaluates<br/>scaling engines + GPU plugin
    end

    rect rgb(224, 255, 224)
        Note over WVA,Scale: Scale Actuation
        WVA->>KubeAPI: List Nodes<br/>GPU-aware scheduling
        KubeAPI-->>WVA: Node info + GPU capacity
        WVA->>KubeAPI: List ResourceQuotas<br/>GPU rebalancing plugin
        KubeAPI-->>WVA: Quota allocations
        WVA->>Scale: Update Scale subresource<br/>Deployment or LeaderWorkerSet
        Scale-->>WVA: Scale applied
    end

    Note over WVA: Observability
    participant Mon as Monitoring<br/>ServiceMonitor
    WVA->>Mon: Expose metrics<br/>:8443/TCP TLS<br/>TokenReview + SAR auth
